Kumite Scoreboard - Karate

With this app, you can use your iDevice to keep the scores while training on your dojo, or at a tournament.
You may also connect your iDevice to a second screen, like a TV, projector or AirPlay, to show everyone around the game score.

Features:
 - Different view for external display (without the score buttons and time buttons);
 - Displays the competition name (you can show the level of the players. Ex: Sen, Juv, Sub-21, etc)
 - Switch sides for AKA and AO;
 - Senchu notification;
 - Set the combat time from 30s to 6 minutes;
 - Swype right/left with 1 finger to remove/add 5 seconds to combat time. If you use 2 fingers, you will remove/add 10 seconds to combat time;
 - Warning sounds at Atoshi Baraku (15s) and at the end of the game;
 - Display photo and name of each player;
 - Check the events of the game and share them.

With the support of AKRAM - Associação de Karaté da Região Autónoma da Madeira.

Developed by Proinov, Lda.
